      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, my bosch dishwasher is acting really weird. it's giving me an e15 error, but there's zero water on the floor, so it feels like the machine is intentionally hiding the leak or sabotaging itself. \n\nit's like the water is just being kept in this dark, cluttered, impossible-to-reach space right under the motor or something. i can't see anything in there, it's just a black hole of wires and hoses. can you tell me how to actually get that bottom panel off and what i should look for to find where this water is lurking?",
